<td><a name="agenda110872" class="Agenda Agenda1" href="https://cheyenne.granicus.com/MediaPlayer.php?view_id=2&clip_id=811&meta_id=110872" onclick="">Announcement of Public Hearing to be held August 23, 2021 at 6:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, 2101 O&rsquo;Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming, and via electronic conference meeting, to hear public comment regarding the intent of the City of Cheyenne to submit an application for funding for the Wyoming Business Council&rsquo;s Business Ready Community Grant and Loan, Managed Data Center Cost Reduction Grant not to exceed $2,250,000.00 for reducing the communications and utility costs for three years through the reimbursement of accrued utility expenses and encouraging employment and private investment by Project Bison.</a> </td></tr> </tbody></table></div><br>
